
<%args>
$debug => ''
</%args>

<%perl>

=head2 bac_search

  Desc: sub bac_search
  Args: n/a
  Ret : BAC tab format

  Defines the format of the BAC tab using html & perl. Speicfies
  information fields available for searching BACs. Prints the debug
  checkbox when debug parameter is set to one.

=cut

</%perl>

<form name="bulkform" action="/tools/bulk/download" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">

<br />
<table summary="" cellpadding="10" width="100%"><tr><td valign="top" bgcolor="#EEEEEE" width="320">


<br />
輸入識別碼列表，或上傳以空格/換行/製表符分隔的識別碼檔案(Enter a list of identifiers or upload a file containing identifiers separated by whitespace)：<br />
<table summary="" width="100%"><tr><td>
<textarea name="ids" rows="5" cols="20"></textarea>
</td>
<td>
<i>範例(Example)：</i>
<pre style="border: 1px solid gray; width: 10em; height: 5em">
LE_HBa0033F11
SL_MboI0001A07
SL_EcoRI0022A07

</pre>
</td></tr></table>
<br />
<br />
及/或上傳識別碼列表檔案(And/or upload list file)：<br /><input type="file" name="file" />
<br />
<br />

</td><td valign="top" bgcolor="#EEEEEE" width="320">
<b>下載 BAC 資訊(Download BAC information)：</b> <br />
<div style="margin: 1em; white-space: nowrap">
  <input type="checkbox" name="arizona_clone_name" checked="checked"  /> Arizona 風格選殖株名稱 (LE_HBa0001A01) (Arizona-style clone name)<br />
  <input type="checkbox" name="cornell_clone_name" checked="checked"  /> 舊 Cornell 風格選殖株名稱 (P001A01) (Old Cornell-style clone name)<br />
  <input type="checkbox" name="chr_clone_name" checked="checked"  /> 含染色體之選殖株名稱 (C01HBa0001A01) (Clone name with chromosome)<br />
  <input type="checkbox" name="clone_type" checked="checked" /> 選殖株類型(clone type)<br />
  <input type="checkbox" name="org_name" checked="checked" /> 物種生物名稱(organism name)<br />
  <input type="checkbox" name="accession_name" checked="checked" /> 品系/材料名稱(accession name)<br />
  <input type="checkbox" name="library_name" checked="checked" /> 文庫名稱(library name)<br />
  <input type="checkbox" name="estimated_length" checked="checked" /> 預估長度(estimated length)<br />
  <input type="checkbox" name="genbank_accession" checked="checked" /> GenBank 登錄號(genbank accession)<br />
<!--	<input type="checkbox" name="overgo_matches" checked="checked" DISABLED /> overgo matches<br /> -->
</div>

</td></tr></table>

%    if ( $debug eq "1" ) {
%        print qq|<input type="checkbox" checked="checked" name="debug" /> 列印除錯訊息(print debug statements)<br /><br />|;
%    }

<input type="hidden" name="idType" value="bac" />
<input type="reset" value="重設(Reset)" />&nbsp;&nbsp;
<input type="submit" value="送出(Submit)"><br />
</form>

